WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.706
"Wow," Terrell said. "I won an award for my good grades."

2
00:00:05.707 --> 00:00:08.301
"Congratulations!" Jack said.

3
00:00:08.302 --> 00:00:11.644
Mara smiled. "You deserve it, Terrell.

4
00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:14.126
You're a great student."

5
