10
00:00:30.799 --> 00:00:35.858
"Yeah," Terrell said. "I work hard in school."

11
00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:37.697
Roxy held up her hands.

12
00:00:37.698 --> 00:00:42.540
"Okay, okay! I'm happy for you, Terrell."

13
